  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat age-based allowance rule does Shawna use to calculate her father's weekly allowance? Shawna's father is six times as old as Shawna. The allowance is paid weekly.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "LOSSY SELF-SUMMARY; VERIFY AGAINST NEW INPUTS\nVISIBLE PREFIX THROUGH TURN 5; LOSSY EXTRACT:\n- {\"content\":\"Actually, that was wrong. Shawna is three times as old as Aliya.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Let Aliya’s age be \\\\(x\\\\) years.\\n\\n- Shawna is three times as old as Aliya:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\text{Shawna}=3x\\n\\\\]\\n\\n- Shawna’s father is five times as old as Shawna:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\text{Father}=5(3x)=15x\\n\\\\]\\n\\nTherefore, Shawna...\n- {\"content\":\"I should also tell you: Aliya is 3 years old.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Aliya is \\\\(3\\\\) years old.\\n\\n1. Shawna is three times Aliya’s age:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n3 \\\\times 3 = 9\\n\\\\]\\n\\nSo, Shawna is \\\\(9\\\\) years old.\\n\\n2. Shawna’s father is five times Shawna’s age:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n5 \\\\times 9 = 45\\n\\\\]\\n\\nSo...",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: Shawna gives her father an allowance equal to 2 dollars for each year of his age.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Let Shawna’s age be \\(x\\) years.\n\n1. Her father is six times her age:\n   \\[\n   \\text{Father's age}=6x\n   \\]\n\n2. Shawna gives him \\(\\$2\\) for each year of his age:\n   \\[\n   \\text{Weekly allowance}=2(6x)=12x\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, Shawna’s rule is to give her father **\\(\\$2\\) per year of his age each week**, or equivalently, **\\(\\$12\\) per year of Shawna’s age each week**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Weekly allowance}=2(\\text{father's age})=12(\\text{Shawna's age})\\text{ dollars}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: How old is Shawna's father?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Shawna’s father is **six times Shawna’s age**. If Shawna is \\(x\\) years old, then:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Father's age}=6x\\text{ years}}\n\\]\n\nA specific age cannot be determined unless Shawna’s age is given.",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
